# JAS Secrets-Detection demo fixture.
#
# EVERY value below is FAKE and NON-FUNCTIONAL — randomly generated for this
# demo, never live credentials, and not loaded by any code in this repo.
# They exist purely so JFrog's Secrets Detection scanner has one example of
# each detector category to find, and so Token Validation correctly reports
# them as inactive/revoked (since they were never real to begin with).
#
# Categories demonstrated:
#   - Access Tokens / Keys
#   - Certificate & Private Key Detection
#   - High Entropy Textual Secrets
#   - URL Secrets Detection

